  "title": "CMake: Look for libpcap headers in pcap/pcap.h only",
  "description": "libpcap, at least since 1.0, has installed its headers inside a pcap\nsubdirectory, leaving the old header locations for backwards\ncompatibility. Since we require at least that version, we can switch to\nlooking for and including pcap/pcap.h only.\n\nAlso switch from pcap-bpf.h to pcap/bpf.h\n\nPing #20261",
